  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">A19 arbetar f&#xf6;r att v&#xe4;rna om yttrande- och informationsfriheten       globalt. A19 arbetar med standard-setting, bevakning, forskning,      lobbying, kapacitetsuppbyggnad och driver kampanjer f&#xf6;r att v&#xe4;rna och st&#xe4;rka yttrande friheten globalt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A19 is working for the defence of freedom of expression and the       freedom of information globally. A19s core competence is in the legal and political areas of standard-setting and litigation. A 19          monitors, researches, publishes, lobbies, builds capacity and         campaigns on behalf of freedom of expression.</narrative>
  </description>
